OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader admits sexual
OL,4,Aoffences against boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army Cadets leader and former
OL,7,Fcouncillor has admitted five sexual
OL,8,Foffences against a teenage boy, the BBC
OL,9,Fcan now report.
OL,11,FRylan Ray pleaded guilty to three
OL,12,Foffences at Ipswich Crown Court on 10
OL,13,FFebruary, but Judge Leigh imposed a
OL,14,Frestriction preventing the media from
OL,15,Freporting the admissions immediately.
OL,17,FThe 26-year-old of Westgate,
OL,18,FPeterborough, admitted a further two
OL,19,Fcharges of making indecent photographs
OL,20,Fof the same boy on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
